              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Daudi daqeemuú amoodá' gwa aleeslayká as Mungú nguwa firin, asma inós ina ló'wa da'ayuút as paángadá' malaykamoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kon.",
          "type": "text",
